      "lines": [
        "102. 解方程：",
        "а) $\\frac{x-3}{x}=0$；　　б) $\\frac{2x+7}{x-2}=0$；",
        "в) $\\frac{(x+3)(x-1)}{x^2-7}=0$；　г) $\\frac{(2x-1)(x+4)}{x+3}=0$；",
        "д) $\\frac{x^2-16}{2x}=0$；　　е) $\\frac{x^2+16}{x}=0$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "103",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "103. 下列函数的图象和坐标轴是否相交？如果相交，指出交",
        "点的坐标。",
        "а) $y=\\frac{x-4}{8}$；　　б) $y=\\frac{x}{12}$；",
        "в) $y=\\frac{(x+5)(x-7)}{10}$；　г) $y=\\frac{4}{x+9}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "104",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "104. 求分式的定义域，并且证明：当变量取定义域内任何值",
        "时，分式的值等于零。",
        "а) $\\frac{x(x-5)-0.5x(2x-10)}{x-2}$；",
        "б) $\\frac{(a+1)^2-(a-1)^2-4a}{2a+6}$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "105",
